<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://staroltest.github.io/indie-game-hot/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 03:18:36 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>10月中国游戏市场收入300亿元同比减少4.27%：手游下滑2.2%，PC下滑15%</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/606588</link><description>伽马数据报告显示 10 月中国游戏市场实际销售收入 300 亿元、同比下降 4.27%，其中手游下滑 2.2%、PC 端下滑 15%。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:20:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">bbca242b56331ed890aaaf6f593b6c33b511d943</guid><source url="http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/606588">GameLook</source></item><item><title>用 Unreal Engine 把 Anyma 的 Coachella 演出扩展为广播 AR</title><link>https://www.unrealengine.com/spotlights/expanding-anymas-coachella-performance-into-broadcast-ar-with-unreal-engine</link><description>Anyma 的 Coachella 现场借助 Unreal Engine、MetaHuman 与广播 AR 技术，把音乐视觉体验带给了线上观众。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">337da5318251a6bfe1b582440f1fa57277a240c1</guid><source url="https://www.unrealengine.com/spotlights/expanding-anymas-coachella-performance-into-broadcast-ar-with-unreal-engine">Unreal Engine 博客</source></item><item><title>新一波单人 AI 游戏制作者赚到钱了吗？并没有</title><link>https://mobilegamer.biz/are-the-new-wave-of-solo-ai-game-makers-making-any-money-no-not-really</link><description>用 Claude Code 等 AI 工具做的游戏正涌入应用商店，但真正赚到钱或获得下载量的寥寥无几，单人 AI 开发的变现现实远比热度冷清。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:19:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e17dc5b4c9c27b40eaf0fe5ec13cc3beff8d9cd5</guid><source url="https://mobilegamer.biz/are-the-new-wave-of-solo-ai-game-makers-making-any-money-no-not-really">MobileGamer.biz</source></item><item><title>我如何为几款经典 PC 游戏写了非官方原生 64 位 Linux/ARM64 SDL2 引擎</title><link>https://dev.to/aionedge/how-i-built-unofficial-native-64-bit-linuxarm64-sdl2-engines-for-a-few-classic-pc-games-2694</link><description>作者分享自己为几款老游戏手写原生 64 位 Linux 与 ARM64 引擎的技术笔记，让它们摆脱 Wine 与旧 32 位环境的束缚。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 21:18:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">09abe47809036a41c1a8ea64ad61adc3ddca23e8</guid><source url="https://dev.to/aionedge/how-i-built-unofficial-native-64-bit-linuxarm64-sdl2-engines-for-a-few-classic-pc-games-2694">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Spine 对比 Exode：游戏骨骼动画与界面骨骼动画之争</title><link>https://dev.to/shinoj_cm_6b559b3ab51bf47/spine-vs-exode-skeletal-animation-for-games-vs-skeletal-animation-for-interfaces-4oab</link><description>Spine 是游戏 2D 骨骼动画十余年的默认选择，Exode 近一年补齐了骨骼、IK 与权重绘制，两者功能表面重叠，实则面向不同的产物，选错会浪费数月，文章具体划清了各自的适用边界。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:24:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">67deaa1a246e0e0931d393934ba4868c6845acde</guid><source url="https://dev.to/shinoj_cm_6b559b3ab51bf47/spine-vs-exode-skeletal-animation-for-games-vs-skeletal-animation-for-interfaces-4oab">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>gta4-reversed：用 C++20 运行时重实现 GTA IV，进度突破 1%</title><link>https://dev.to/master4824/gta4-reversed-starting-a-c20-runtime-reimplementation-of-gta-iv-1070-crossing-1-e5</link><description>这个开源项目直接对 PC 版 GTA IV 1.0.7.0 可执行文件做运行时 ASI 注入重写，现已实现 462 个函数、跨过 1% 里程碑，代码按 MIT 协议开源。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:00:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">002cd5ef16f3d8854b3bcc8c5ddea938d10320bb</guid><source url="https://dev.to/master4824/gta4-reversed-starting-a-c20-runtime-reimplementation-of-gta-iv-1070-crossing-1-e5">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>怎样写游戏提示词，才能让 AI 做出你想象中的游戏</title><link>https://dev.to/tyrboai/how-to-write-a-game-prompt-that-builds-the-game-you-imagine-3api</link><description>一份好的游戏提示词要说清玩家做什么、什么在阻挠、怎么才算赢、画面什么样，再加一个属于你自己的点子，文章用正反例子拆解了这五个部分。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:43:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">8b3b6899c93d043e2d1f16ad4841a533ebb0317c</guid><source url="https://dev.to/tyrboai/how-to-write-a-game-prompt-that-builds-the-game-you-imagine-3api">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>在 Unreal Engine 5 中打造实时沙漠神庙场景</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/creating-real-time-desert-temple-environment-in-unreal-engine-5</link><description>作者分享了如何把沙漠神庙的概念原画扩展成实时场景，在写实与风格化之间找到平衡。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 02:49:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">843fbf4e1540613e2a632bcd21d7a7d2ab616b10</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/creating-real-time-desert-temple-environment-in-unreal-engine-5">80 Level</source></item><item><title>用这套优化工具包让 Unreal Engine 5 项目保持干净</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/keep-unreal-engine-5-projects-clean-with-this-optimization-toolkit</link><description>Leartes Studios 的编辑器扩展能给项目健康度打分、找出闲置资产并梳理依赖关系，帮 UE5 开发者把项目里的杂物清出去。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:11:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3ce9d8e2ac71fd8d4ee2e710010b525e54322835</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/keep-unreal-engine-5-projects-clean-with-this-optimization-toolkit">80 Level</source></item><item><title>用 HTML5 Canvas 与 WebSockets 打造实时多人棋盘游戏引擎：Ludo Classic 架构解析</title><link>https://dev.to/uchitchakma/building-a-real-time-multiplayer-board-game-engine-with-html5-canvas-websockets-the-architecture-10a4</link><description>作者拆解一款实时多人棋盘游戏的引擎架构，讲 Canvas 渲染与 WebSocket 同步如何支撑回合制对局。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 03:36:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">88e75b91ad9b7b716d17c88b0da6dd320118eb68</guid><source url="https://dev.to/uchitchakma/building-a-real-time-multiplayer-board-game-engine-with-html5-canvas-websockets-the-architecture-10a4">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我做了一个 AI 助手，能用一句话聊天指令改 Unreal Engine 蓝图</title><link>https://dev.to/dola_ai_pro/i-built-an-ai-agent-that-edits-unreal-engine-blueprints-from-a-chat-prompt-3d4d</link><description>独立开发者花一年做的 Dola AI 嵌进 UE5 编辑器里，用自然语言描述需求就能让多智能体改蓝图、写 C++ 并自动试玩验证，文章讲了它怎么工作、还差在哪。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 04:33:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5a368a99abb674e259c4b4bc19b38e53f1d02ea5</gui